  "usage": {
    "summary": "`good-date-input` combines the existing GoodUI Input with a calendar. It accepts typed dates in the current browser locale and stores values in stable local ISO strings. It supports a single day, a range, multiple days, a month, or a year. The popover provides day, month, and year views; at narrow widths or on coarse-pointer devices it becomes a near-full-screen modal overlay.",
